cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. See also
  the manuscript this code supports, "Effects of drying and milling
  treatments on estimates of foliar functional traits with VSWIR
  spectroscopy" (full citation TBD), the companion data record on Zenodo
  (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23504460), which holds the spectra,
  chemistry and all supporting files.
title: "Analysis code for the effects of drying and milling treatments on estimates of foliar functional traits with VSWIR spectroscopy"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24143221"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EnSpec/MillTest"
authors:
